Hi {!Case.Contact},

Thank you for reaching out to EverQuote. I'd be happy to show you how to pause your account so that you don't receive any leads when you don't want to.

1. Sign into your EverQuote Pro account by going to https://pro.everquote.com/signin
2. Click on the red "Pause" button.
3. Select a Pause Reason from the drop-down window and click "Next".
4. Here, you can choose to pause now or to schedule a pause in the future.
5. Once you have specified the date and time you want your campaign to automatically restart on, click on the red "Pause" button.

To restart your campaign at any given time, you can sign in to your EverQuote Pro account and click on the green "Run" button.

If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us anytime via email or by calling us at 844-707-8800 Option 1.

Best Regards,